00:08:56.702 --> 00:08:58.120
Can I get someone else to come in

00:08:58.204 --> 00:08:58.663
and take my...

00:08:58.746 --> 00:08:59.413
If you find someone else

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:00.331
Yeah!

00:09:00.706 --> 00:09:01.123
Go!

00:09:01.999 --> 00:09:02.458
One!

00:09:02.959 --> 00:09:03.334
Two!

00:09:03.626 --> 00:09:04.043
Three!

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:05.962
Now you definitely have it

00:09:07.922 --> 00:09:09.715
Oh no!

00:09:09.882 --> 00:09:10.341
Three!

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:12.301
Don't mess up the serve

00:09:12.385 --> 00:09:12.718
One!

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:13.094
Go!

00:09:17.265 --> 00:09:18.849
Also fast tempo

00:09:18.891 --> 00:09:20.518
Fast tempo but looking strong

00:09:20.685 --> 00:09:21.811
this pair as well

00:09:22.144 --> 00:09:22.728
30 seconds

00:09:22.812 --> 00:09:23.980
Nice and chill!

00:09:24.188 --> 00:09:24.814
The pressure in on

00:09:24.897 --> 00:09:25.898
Nothing special, mate!

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:30.403
Can they do it?

00:09:30.486 --> 00:09:31.320
You can do it!

00:09:31.571 --> 00:09:32.863
Don't hit it too far

00:09:32.905 --> 00:09:33.447
Feeling the pressure!

00:09:34.448 --> 00:09:36.284
The lights don't help, guys

00:09:36.367 --> 00:09:36.909
Just saying!

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:38.869
Five!

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:39.745
Wow!

00:09:39.787 --> 00:09:40.580
Four!

00:09:41.163 --> 00:09:41.998
Three!

00:09:42.039 --> 00:09:42.748
Aaah!

00:09:42.832 --> 00:09:43.708
Two!

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.876
No!

00:09:46.168 --> 00:09:47.420
One second!

00:09:47.962 --> 00:09:48.921
Are you joking?

00:09:52.174 --> 00:09:52.800
I was about to say:

00:09:52.883 --> 00:09:53.968
"Don't worry about the pendulum

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:54.677
it will never hit"

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:55.303
No!

00:09:55.428 --> 00:09:57.096
We're going to have to check the replay

00:09:57.138 --> 00:09:58.723
because that was on the second

00:09:58.806 --> 00:09:59.599
Oh my god!

00:09:59.682 --> 00:10:00.850
When did the ball hit the ground

00:10:00.975 --> 00:10:01.851
and go out?

00:10:01.976 --> 00:10:02.435
Just saying

00:10:02.518 --> 00:10:03.811
That's a good point

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:05.271
If it hits the ground...

00:10:05.396 --> 00:10:06.897
The ball didn't hit the ground before

00:10:07.023 --> 00:10:07.773
I think you got it

00:10:07.857 --> 00:10:08.899
Yeah!

00:10:09.567 --> 00:10:10.234
Thank guys!

00:10:10.359 --> 00:10:11.277
Thank you very much!

00:10:11.319 --> 00:10:11.986
Hundred pounds

00:10:12.069 --> 00:10:12.570
Thank you guys!

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:13.321
That's really kind

00:10:13.446 --> 00:10:14.780
Make sure you hit subscribe

00:10:15.323 --> 00:10:16.782
and see you next time

00:10:17.074 --> 00:10:18.159
And huge thanks to

00:10:18.159 --> 00:10:18.993
Bounce Old Street

00:10:19.076 --> 00:10:21.162
for letting us use their amazing venue

00:16:02.378 --> 00:16:05.381
I've just got to stand next to
the table and look at

00:16:05.381 --> 00:16:17.643
them.

